        <mxCell id="summary" value="GPIO Summary (all 15 pins used)&#10;─────────────────────────&#10;GPIO  0 → OV5647 PWDN (drive LOW)&#10;GPIO  1 → OV5647 MCLK (24 MHz clock)&#10;GPIO  4 → MI0802 nRESET&#10;GPIO  5 → MI0802 DATA_READY (IRQ)&#10;GPIO  7 → Shared I2C SDA (OV5647 0x36 + MI0802 0x40)&#10;GPIO  8 → Shared I2C SCL&#10;GPIO 14-17 → C6 SDIO D0-D3&#10;GPIO 18 → C6 SDIO CLK&#10;GPIO 19 → C6 SDIO CMD&#10;GPIO 20 → MI0802 SPI CLK&#10;GPIO 21 → MI0802 SPI MOSI&#10;GPIO 22 → MI0802 SPI MISO&#10;GPIO 23 → MI0802 SPI CS&#10;GPIO 25 → Servo PWM (LEDC 50 Hz)&#10;GPIO 54 → C6 Reset" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Courier New;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
